--- Schema (amazon_reviews/homemade_erasure) ---

Facet 0: review_sentiment (categorical)
  Captures the overall sentiment expressed by the reviewer toward the product.
  - positive
  - negative
  - mixed
  - neutral
  - Other

Facet 1: review_focus (categorical)
  The primary product attribute or dimension the reviewer focuses on when evaluating the item.
  - quality_and_durability
  - fit_and_sizing
  - value_for_price
  - usability_and_ease_of_use
  - aesthetics_and_design
  - shipping_and_packaging
  - accuracy_of_description
  - Other

Facet 2: reviewer_purchase_motivation (categorical)
  Captures the reviewer's stated reason or context for purchasing the product, distinguishing who or what the item was intended for.
  - personal_use
  - gift_for_others
  - professional_or_work_use
  - household_shared_use
  - resale_or_bulk_use
  - Other

